{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/冰原震吼","pageid":8539,"revid":21548,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E9%9C%87%E5%90%BC&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E9%9C%87%E5%90%BC&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E9%9C%87%E5%90%BC&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>冰原震吼</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.86.B0.E5.8E.9F.E9.9C.87.E5.90.BC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冰原震吼\"><b>冰原震吼</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 冰原震吼.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d8/muzug7gww5kyhu1wc241lg588a3wqj9.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E9%9C%87%E5%90%BC.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d8/muzug7gww5kyhu1wc241lg588a3wqj9.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E9%9C%87%E5%90%BC.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d8/muzug7gww5kyhu1wc241lg588a3wqj9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />冰原震吼\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>十字1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"能量倾泻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">能量倾泻</font></span></span>]，选择自身十字范围内[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]并对范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内的敌人，造成（<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>+<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>×✦）物攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。攻击前施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>+✦层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">粉碎</font></span></span>]。冲锋途经地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：自身专属技能可储存[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"溢出伤害值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">溢出伤害值</font></span></span>]的一半（不超过生命值的300%）。以专属技能攻击后，若受击目标存活或自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内敌人存活，则把储存值平均地对以上敌人造成伤害。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 十字1-3 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5e/g4hyhbuqq2gul3adf57ogwftdcx2cgv.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%971-3_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5e/g4hyhbuqq2gul3adf57ogwftdcx2cgv.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"97\" data-file-height=\"97\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E6%9B%BC\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿尔曼\"><im